Intelligent Meeting Scheduler

Introduction:

This project aims to find a suitable time for scheduling meetings based on the availability of all participants. 
The system checks the available time slots, meeting duration, and other scheduling conditions before selecting a meeting time. 
It helps companies save time and avoid scheduling conflicts by choosing a slot that meets all the given requirements.

Prompt:
Check the available time slots and scheduling conditions carefully. 
Select a suitable meeting time that matches the required meeting duration and the availability of all participants.
Make sure the meeting does not conflict with anyone's schedule and follows the given time restrictions. Select only from the provided slots. 
Do not assume or create any availability information. If no suitable time is available, return NO_AVAILABLE_SLOT. Provide only the selected time slot 
or NO_AVAILABLE_SLOT without any explanation.


